 experience OpenClaw with less setup and less maintenance. The official OpenClaw cloud platform. Launch your automated AI agent without coding.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7d17fafb92201def\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"duckduckgo.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"37826ca67a615546\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw Agents 指令完全指南：add、list、config 與模型配置\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"37826ca67a615546\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.meta-intelligence.tech/insight-openclaw-agents-guide\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6b125bc9462cd35f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n完整解析 OpenClaw agents add、agents list、config set 等核心指令語法，涵蓋模型設定、代理新增、配置檔結構與進階管理技巧。附可直接複製的指令範例。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6b125bc9462cd35f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.meta-intelligence.tech\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f67301f0441d221d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n多 Agent 配置 | 指南 | OpenClaw 中文教程\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f67301f0441d221d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openclawgithub.cc/guide/agents/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f2ad06c0b3188258\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw 多 Agent 配置指南，学习如何创建和管理多个专业化的 AI Agent ，实现任务分工和协作。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f2ad06c0b3188258\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"openclawgithub.cc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b5ad2d273a79f15c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw 多 Agent 配置完整指南 - 直角漫步 - 博客园\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b5ad2d273a79f15c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cnblogs.com/zhaoxxnbsp/p/19796149\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dd40f48ea60b8511\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n本文档详细说明如何在 OpenClaw 中配置多个独立的 Agent （智能体），实现不同用途、不同人格、不同渠道的隔离使用。 目录 概念介绍 准备工作 方法一：使用向导添加 Agent 方法二：手动配置（推荐） 配置路由绑定 为每个 Agent 设置人设 进阶配置 验证与管理 常见场景示例 故障排除\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dd40f48ea60b8511\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnblogs.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"254dc7019251e0b1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nagents - OpenClaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"254dc7019251e0b1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agents\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f11ff5dc2b686b48\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRouting bindings Use routing bindings to pin inbound channel traffic to a specific agent . If you also want different visible skills per agent , configure agents .defaults.skills and agents .list[].skills in openclaw .json. See Skills config and Configuration Reference. List bindings:\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f11ff5dc2b686b48\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.openclaw.ai\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"openclaw add agent 完整命令","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1023,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e9875edf63ba4495\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOpenclaw For Beginners | Quick OpenClaw Setup\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e9875edf63ba4495\">>>","url":"https://duckduckgo.com/y.js?ad_domain=clawbro.ai&ad_provider=bingv7aa&ad_type=txad&click_metadata=DNMUp0jHbcusYrN_vn6h1L41atiJMZyoLQ6rMYVuQtN_p%2DoYAdqTyxz9K1k7GJLMDYSlNALB0L_vOqh5WRUcEeblkjsOB4gJ87M05wdLzIDfXDgq9YvLFofuwQ0OTH6ak7rArsIAlqxcyQNWALoIx8C4GLXlN5%2DrHWh9bdCNt34.qDdaKo4G9Ip7zZEXivAyVw&rut=865b072a324832d70e1e7cfd5f441ecd0977629afdf28556d70eb09a152bfa6b&u3=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bing.com%2Faclick%3Fld%3De8%2D3TJWDGFscxyFX4cseopwzVUCUzSBgpYj61e_mNL1VaG7W9He%2DH0zUOtNvYCuVFdim8654wlGhh7bMB35fBapflQkWEbvfObkfsG0xbv0fiOGKs3zcjyk5H9jOky%2DeH2dJo1JcGLFBSFIu4H47KhoIJo1BsIqNFKIR1AjTan0vpa%2DHH6qTISfwCh01y9G